# Abandoned Starlight migration

This branch (`codex/astro-starlight-migration`) is **not** the target architecture. Do not add Starlight features, Pelagornis usage, or more `scripts/generate-content.mjs` behavior.

Read `docs/plain-astro-restart.md` before any migration, graph, URL, or content-pipeline work.

**Target:** plain Astro, owned layouts, content collections on `content/` + TIL submodule, Pagefind, TOC from `render().headings`. Optional local graph from **real** links only via `starlight-site-graph` in vanilla Astro mode.

**Do not:** merge this branch to `master`, install another blog theme, synthesize graph edges from tags, or “fix” Starlight into a blog in place. Start a **new branch from current `origin/master`** and copy salvage items listed in that doc.
